<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose France?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            World-Class Education
                            <p class="fs-5">France boasts prestigious universities and institutions offering high-quality education, particularly in fields like business, engineering, and arts, ensuring students gain globally recognized qualifications and skills.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Affordable Tuition Fees
                            <p class="fs-5">Studying in France won’t break the bank! Public universities offer super low tuition fees compared to many other countries, making it a great choice for international students who want quality education without the hefty price tag.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Rich Cultural Experience
                            <p class="fs-5">France is a cultural goldmine! From its iconic art and history to its vibrant lifestyle, studying here means you’ll be surrounded by endless opportunities to dive into a rich and inspiring cultural environment.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Diverse Study Programs
                            <p class="fs-5">Whether you’re into science, arts, business, or something else, French universities have you covered. They offer a huge variety of programs in both English and French, so there’s something for everyone’s interests and career goals.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Global Career Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5">
                                Studying in France can be a career game-changer. With many multinational companies based here and strong alumni networks worldwide, you’ll have plenty of opportunities to kickstart an international career.
                            </p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Innovative Research Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5">If you’re into research, France is the place to be! It’s a hub for innovation, offering access to advanced facilities and chances to work on groundbreaking projects that could shape the future.</p>
                        </li>
                         <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Fashion and Design Excellence
                            <p class="fs-5">Renowned as the global fashion capital, France offers exceptional courses in fashion and design, providing students with unparalleled exposure to the industry and opportunities to learn from top professionals.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Central European Location
                            <p class="fs-5">France’s central location in Europe makes it easy for students to travel to nearby countries like Spain, Germany, and Italy. This allows them to explore diverse cultures, broaden their perspectives, and enhance their overall study-abroad experience.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img src="~/assets/images/france/france.jpg" style="border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 10px #3a397d54;" alt="Study Abroad France" title="Study Abroad France" loading="lazy">
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>



